keywords:
  - "bone metastasis"
  - "single-cell RNA sequencing"
  - "spatial transcriptomics"
  - "reproducibility"
  - "transportability"
abstract: >-
  Sanitized code, frozen configurations and provenance records supporting a
  patient-aware, failure-aware multicohort analysis of bone-metastasis single-cell
  and spatial transcriptomic data. Provider-controlled and third-party inputs are
  excluded and must be obtained from their original sources.
